cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pandion Plots in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Pandion Plots"
abstract: >-
  A free graphing app for creating clear, customizable statistical
  figures without writing code. Runs in the browser, as a portable
  download, or as a jamovi module.
type: software
authors:
